term>AFFLICTION, Prayer Under</term><br /><br />- Should take encouragement from former mercies<br /><scripRef>Ps 27:9; 2Co 1:10</scripRef><br /><br />- Examples of afflicted Saints:<br />. Joseph<br /><scripRef>Ge 39:20-23; Ps 105:17-19</scripRef><br /><br />. Moses<br /><scripRef>Heb 11:25</scripRef><br /><br />. Eli<br /><scripRef>1Sa 3:18</scripRef><br /><br />. Nehemiah<br /><scripRef>Ne 1:4</scripRef><br /><br />. Job<br /><scripRef>Job 1:20-22</scripRef><br /><br />. David<br /><scripRef>2Sa 12:15-23</scripRef><br /><br />. Paul<br /><scripRef>Ac 20:22-24; 21:13</scripRef><br /><br />. Apostles<br /><scripRef>1Co 4:13; 2Co 6:4-10</scripRef>

AFFLICTION, CONSOLATION UNDER
