- Foretold<br /><scripRef>Joe 2:28; Ac 2:16-18</scripRef><br /><br />- All Scripture given by<br /><scripRef>2Sa 23:2; 2Ti 3:16; 2Pe 1:21</scripRef><br /><br />- DESIGN OF<br />. To reveal future events<br /><scripRef>Ac 1:16; 28:25; 1Pe 1:11</scripRef><br /><br />. To reveal the mysteries of God<br /><scripRef>Am 3:7; 1Co 2:10</scripRef><br /><br />. To give power to ministers<br /><scripRef>Mic 3:8; Ac 1:8</scripRef><br /><br />. To direct ministers<br /><scripRef>Eze 3:24-27; Ac 11:12; 13:2</scripRef><br /><br />. To control ministers<br /><scripRef>Ac 16:6</scripRef><br /><br />. To testify against sin<br /><scripRef>2Ki 17:13; Ne 9:30; Mic 3:8; Joh 16:8,9</scripRef><br /><br />- MODES OF<br />. Various<br /><scripRef>Heb 1:1</scripRef><br /><br />. By secret impulse<br /><scripRef>Jud 13:25; 2Pe 1:21</scripRef><br /><br />. By a voice<br /><scripRef>Isa 6:8; Ac 8:29; Re 1:10</scripRef><br /><br />. By visions<br /><scripRef>Nu 12:6; Eze 11:24</scripRef><br /><br />. By dreams<br /><scripRef>Nu 12:6; Da 7:1</scripRef><br /><br />- Necessary to prophesying<br /><scripRef>Nu 11:25-27; 2Ch 20:14-17</scripRef><br /><br />- Is irresistible<br /><scripRef>Am 3:8</scripRef><br /><br />- Despisers of, punished<br /><scripRef>2Ch 36:15,16; Zec 7:12</scripRef>

IRON
