- An animal secretion, of a white colour<br /><scripRef>La 4:7</scripRef><br /><br />- Used as food by the Jews<br /><scripRef>Ge 18:8; Jud 5:25</scripRef><br /><br />- DIFFERENT KINDS MENTIONED<br />. Of cows<br /><scripRef>De 32:14; 1Sa 6:7</scripRef><br /><br />. Of camels<br /><scripRef>Ge 32:15</scripRef><br /><br />. Of goats<br /><scripRef>Pr 27:27</scripRef><br /><br />. Of sheep<br /><scripRef>De 32:14</scripRef><br /><br />. Of sea-monsters<br /><scripRef>La 4:3</scripRef><br /><br />- Flocks and herds fed for supply of<br /><scripRef>Pr 27:23,27; Isa 7:21,22; 1Co 9:7</scripRef><br /><br />- Canaan abounded with<br /><scripRef>Ex 3:8,17; Jos 5:6</scripRef><br /><br />- MADE INTO<br />. Butter<br /><scripRef>Pr 30:33</scripRef><br /><br />. Cheese<br /><scripRef>Job 10:10</scripRef><br /><br />- Kept by the Jews in bottles<br /><scripRef>Jud 4:19</scripRef><br /><br />- Young animals not to be seethed in that of the mother<br /><scripRef>Ex 23:19</scripRef><br /><br />- ILLUSTRATIVE OF<br />. Temporal blessings<br /><scripRef>Ge 49:12</scripRef><br /><br />. Blessings of the gospel<br /><scripRef>Isa 55:1; Joe 3:18</scripRef><br /><br />. First principles of God's word<br /><scripRef>1Co 3:2; Heb 5:12; 1Pe 2:2</scripRef><br /><br />. Godly and edifying discourses<br /><scripRef>So 4:11</scripRef><br /><br />. Wealth of the Gentiles<br /><scripRef>Isa 60:16</scripRef><br /><br />. Doctrines of the gospel<br /><scripRef>So 5:1</scripRef>

