- Performed through the power of the devil<br /><scripRef>2Th 2:9; Re 16:14</scripRef><br /><br />- WROUGHT<br />. In support of false religions<br /><scripRef>De 13:1-2</scripRef><br /><br />. By false christs<br /><scripRef>Mt 24:24</scripRef><br /><br />. By false prophets<br /><scripRef>Mt 24:24; Re 19:20</scripRef><br /><br />- A mark of the Apostasy<br /><scripRef>2Th 2:3,9; Re 13:13</scripRef><br /><br />- Not to be regarded<br /><scripRef>De 13:3</scripRef><br /><br />- Deceive the ungodly<br /><scripRef>2Th 2:10-12; Re 13:14; 19:20</scripRef><br /><br />- Exemplified<br />. Magicians of Egypt<br /><scripRef>Ex 7:11,22; 8:7</scripRef><br /><br />. Witch of Endor<br /><scripRef>1Sa 28:7-14</scripRef><br /><br />. Simon Magus<br /><scripRef>Ac 8:9-11</scripRef>

