nd their<br />powers to bear<br /><scripRef>1Co 10:13</scripRef><br /><br />- God will make a way for saints to escape out of<br /><scripRef>1Co 10:13</scripRef><br /><br />- God enables the saints to bear<br /><scripRef>1Co 10:13</scripRef><br /><br />- God knows how to deliver saints out of<br /><scripRef>2Pe 2:9</scripRef><br /><br />- Christ keeps faithful saints from the hour of<br /><scripRef>Re 3:10</scripRef><br /><br />- Saints may be in heaviness through<br /><scripRef>1Pe 1:6</scripRef><br /><br />- SAINTS SHOULD<br />. Resist, in faith<br /><scripRef>Eph 6:16; 1Pe 5:9</scripRef><br /><br />. Watch against<br /><scripRef>Mt 26:41; 1Pe 5:8</scripRef><br /><br />. Pray to be kept from<br /><scripRef>Mt 6:13; 26:41</scripRef><br /><br />. Not to occasion, to others<br /><scripRef>Ro 14:13</scripRef><br /><br />. Restore those overcome by<br /><scripRef>Ga 6:1</scripRef><br /><br />. Avoid the way of<br /><scripRef>Pr 4:14,15</scripRef><br /><br />- The devil will renew<br /><scripRef>Lu 4:13</scripRef><br /><br />- Has strength through the weakness of the flesh<br /><scripRef>Mt 26:41</scripRef><br /><br />- Mere professors fall away in time of<br /><scripRef>Lu 8:13</scripRef><br /><br />- Blessedness of those who meet and overcome<br /><scripRef>Jas 1:2-4,12</scripRef><br /><br />- Exemplified<br />. Eve<br /><scripRef>Ge 3:1,4,5</scripRef><br /><br />. Joseph<br /><scripRef>Ge 39:7</scripRef><br /><br />. Balaam<br /><scripRef>Nu 22:17</scripRef><br /><br />. Achan<br /><scripRef>Jos 7:21</scripRef><br /><br />. David<br /><scripRef>2Sa 11:2</scripRef><br /><br />. Jeroboam<br /><scripRef>1Ki 15:30</scripRef><br /><br />. Peter<br /><scripRef>Mr 14:67-71</scripRef><br /><br />. Paul<br /><scripRef>2Co 12:7; Ga 4:14</scripRef>

