pRef><br /><br />- Shepherds<br /><scripRef>Jer 23:4</scripRef><br /><br />- Soldiers of Christ<br /><scripRef>Php 2:25; 2Ti 2:3</scripRef><br /><br />- Stars<br /><scripRef>Re 1:20; 2:1</scripRef><br /><br />- Stewards of God<br /><scripRef>Tit 1:7</scripRef><br /><br />- Stewards of the grace of God<br /><scripRef>1Pe 4:10</scripRef><br /><br />- Stewards of the mysteries of God<br /><scripRef>1Co 4:1</scripRef><br /><br />- Teachers<br /><scripRef>Isa 30:20; Eph 4:11</scripRef><br /><br />- Watchmen<br /><scripRef>Isa 62:6; Eze 33:7</scripRef><br /><br />- Witnesses<br /><scripRef>Ac 1:8; 5:32; 26:16</scripRef><br /><br />- Workers together with God<br /><scripRef>2Co 6:1</scripRef>

