f>Joh 8:31; 15:8</scripRef><br /><br />- Elect of God<br /><scripRef>Col 3:12; Tit 1:1</scripRef><br /><br />- Epistles of Christ<br /><scripRef>2Co 3:3</scripRef><br /><br />- Excellent, The<br /><scripRef>Ps 16:3</scripRef><br /><br />- Faithful brethren in Christ<br /><scripRef>Col 1:2</scripRef><br /><br />- Faithful, The<br /><scripRef>Ps 12:1</scripRef><br /><br />- Faithful of the land<br /><scripRef>Ps 101:6</scripRef><br /><br />- Fellow-citizens with the saints<br /><scripRef>Eph 2:19</scripRef><br /><br />- Fellow-heirs<br /><scripRef>Eph 3:6</scripRef><br /><br />- Fellow-servants<br /><scripRef>Re 6:11</scripRef><br /><br />- Friends of God<br /><scripRef>2Ch 20:7; Jas 2:23</scripRef><br /><br />- Friends of Christ<br /><scripRef>Joh 15:15</scripRef><br /><br />- Godly, The<br /><scripRef>Ps 4:3; 2Pe 2:9</scripRef><br /><br />- Heirs of God<br /><scripRef>Ro 8:17; Ga 4:7</scripRef><br /><br />- Heirs of the grace of life<br /><scripRef>1Pe 3:7</scripRef><br /><br />- Heirs of the kingdom<br /><scripRef>Jas 2:5</scripRef><br /><br />- Heirs of promise<br /><scripRef>Heb 6:17; Ga 3:29</scripRef><br /><br />- Heirs of salvation<br /><scripRef>Heb 1:14</scripRef><br /><br />- Holy brethren<br /><scripRef>1Th 5:27; Heb 3:1</scripRef><br /><br />- Holy nation<br /><scripRef>Ex 19:6; 1Pe 2:9</scripRef><br /><br />- Holy people<br /><scripRef>De 26:19; Isa 62:12</scripRef><br /><br />- Holy priesthood<br /><scripRef>1Pe 2:5</scripRef><br /><br />- Joint-heirs with Christ<br /><scripRef>Ro 8:17</scripRef><br /><br />- Just, The<br /><scripRef>Hab 2:4</scripRef><br /><br />- Kings and priests to God<br /><scripRef>Re 1:6</scripRef><br /><br />- Kingdom of priests<br /><scripRef>Ex 19:6</scripRef><br /><br />- Lambs<br /><scripRef>Isa 40:11; Joh 21:15</scripRef><br /><br />- Lights of the world<br /><scripRef>Mt 5:14</scripRef><br /><br />- Little children<br /><scripRef>Joh 13:33; 1Jo 2:1</scripRef><br /><br />- Lively stones<br /><scripRef>1Pe 2:5</scripRef><br 